(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-78","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["地方运输组保存[[fax|传真]]尾联，纸[[fiber|纤维]]在灯下[[finely|清晰地]]显出旧折。程雾的[[finger|手指]]伤已不再渗血，但不去揉纸。这页号称来自[[first-rate|第一流的]]新检系统，[[fission|裂变]]教具却混进民用[[flow|流程]]。值班员得过[[flu|流感]]，那天交班有日期[[fluctuation|波动]]，不能凭记忆定时。机修员说另一层灰是[[flux|助焊剂]]残迹，来自旧机房桌，不是箱内物质。接收点合作的[[psychiatrist|精神科医生]]今天给工人提供支持，允许害怕的人先坐下来，不必一进门就说完所有细节。我们等他查台历，不让疲惫替我们凑出方便的时刻。","吴老师说原件不会[[forever|永远]]留在每个人手里，记录才得接续。旧印厂留着[[bourgeois|九点活字]]，[[formerly|从前]]用来印尾联小字；新[[formulation|表述]]删掉的恰是那些小字。我们很[[fortunate|幸运]]，工人曾[[found|创立]]一个互助记录群，每次发货先拍照片。窗外[[fragrant|芳香的]]树气混着汽油，手机里却[[frequently|经常]]有同一个签字。值班员[[fret|烦恼]]，怕图片会[[frighten|吓住]]家属，出现[[frightful|可怕的]]猜测。我们约好仅移交与货相关影像，既不用他的恐惧证明箱有害，也不删掉他亲自做过的事。","运输车往来[[fro|向那边]]与向这边，既可补给，也可把原箱送得[[further|更远]]。[[garage|车库]]师傅愿意[[gather|收集]]交车页，原以为我们的[[gathering|聚集]]只是校庆的[[gay|欢乐的]]排练。不能用这一印象作[[generalization|概括]]；基金的[[generosity|慷慨]]有真部分，旧[[genetics|遗传学]]仪器的混装也有实迹。穿西装的[[gentleman|先生]]催撤联，老陈却按[[geographical|地理的]]位置与箱扣[[geometrical|几何的]]缺角核对。从[[germany|德国]]捐来的旧柜照片只说明原来源，不能替地方组回答后来谁领货。那位先生终于不再拿外国单据挡住国内的签名。","食堂端出[[ginger|姜]]汤，一只教学[[glider|滑翔机]]模型在窗边晃。办公室想[[glorify|美化]]这条运输线，担忧却在[[gnaw|折磨]]值班员。核验[[gradually|逐渐地]]完成，他看手机里[[granddaughter|孙女]]与[[grandson|孙子]]合照，说不能让他们只记得自己签过坏话。基金[[grants|补助金]]支付的是运输，不曾要求他知道所有实验内容；他仍须对看到复核字样却未停货负责。角落一只[[grasshopper|蚱蜢]]钻进[[gray|灰色的]]布袋，我帮它放到窗外。值班员说这些小事看似不影响表，却提醒他货签后面一直有人在生活，并非只有钱款数字。","拍照日期[[greatly|大大地]]改变判断。一页[[greek|希腊的]]旧天文图压在尾联上，新经理发来的[[greeting|问候]]声还在手机。[[grey|灰白的]]纸背写着[[grocery|食品杂货店]]取饭地点，证明尾联由地方组在指定办公室日期之后才打印；办公室曾把改签当预先核验。赵启比对基金台账，发现放行不是单次校对错，至少两次派单都接在删条件之后。叶澄让我们将自己明知异常未追查的时段一并留下，她也愿意去办公室认那台旧扫描机。我望着她的手，没有看见一双因交纸就无辜的手，却看见她终于肯让它们指向自己曾经站过的地方。","地方组交出箱去向：被留存的是站内主壳和一部分分盒，其余尾箱已排入回港补给列车。办公室在收到留存提醒后，另下更改单要求改走河岸支线，没有告诉站方原用途。何警官将手机、尾联、拆分表与白塔原页影像并到同一调度时间线上，站方安排查实际换轨记录。程雾不再只听一段声，她看地图说下一站仍通向临河，回程却与我们来的路不同。老陈已经把备用手套给我，说纸要带，人也要好好带回去。明天去河岸换轨点，查是哪次命令把本应退出运输的旧件又推回潮水旁。"],"en":["The group retained a [[fax|fax]] copy. Its [[fiber|fiber]] showed folds [[finely|finely]] under light. Cheng's healing [[finger|finger]] did not rub it. A supposedly [[first-rate|first-rate]] inspection system put [[fission|fission]] teaching items into civilian [[flow|flow]]. After [[flu|flu]], the clerk's remembered handover showed time [[fluctuation|fluctuation]]; a calendar was needed. A mechanic identified [[flux|flux]] residue from the desk, not box contents. A partner [[psychiatrist|psychiatrist]] offered staff support and time to sit. We let the clerk check dates without making exhaustion supply a convenient answer.","Originals would not stay in every hand [[forever|forever]]. Old [[bourgeois|bourgeois]] type had [[formerly|formerly]] printed small conditions. New [[formulation|formulation]] removed them. We were [[fortunate|fortunate]]: workers had chosen to [[found|found]] a group photographing departures. [[fragrant|Fragrant]] air mixed with petrol while photographs [[frequently|frequently]] repeated signatures. The clerk began to [[fret|fret]]: pictures might [[frighten|frighten]] families into [[frightful|frightful]] guesses. We agreed to transfer cargo-relevant images only, neither converting fear into chemical proof nor erasing his actions.","Vehicles travelled to and [[fro|fro]], carrying supplies or goods [[further|further]]. A [[garage|garage]] technician would [[gather|gather]] receipts, initially mistaking our [[gathering|gathering]] for [[gay|gay]] anniversary rehearsal. That impression justified no [[generalization|generalization]]. Real [[generosity|generosity]] coexisted with mixed [[genetics|genetics]] instruments. A suited [[gentleman|gentleman]] urged withdrawal. Chen matched [[geographical|geographical]] positions and [[geometrical|geometrical]] corner damage. Cabinet photographs from [[germany|Germany]] proved original source, not later recipients. The man finally stopped using foreign papers to conceal local signatures. We retained each statement's actual scope.","[[ginger|Ginger]] soup arrived beneath a swaying [[glider|glider]] model. The office would [[glorify|glorify]] its route; worry continued to [[gnaw|gnaw]] the clerk. Checks [[gradually|gradually]] finished. Looking at his [[granddaughter|granddaughter]] and [[grandson|grandson]], he feared their remembering only harmful signatures. [[grants|Grants]] paid transport, not knowledge of every experiment, but he remained responsible for ignoring visible review conditions. A [[grasshopper|grasshopper]] entered a [[gray|gray]] bag; I released it. Such small actions reminded him that lives continued behind labels, beyond payment numbers.","Photograph dates [[greatly|greatly]] changed our view. A [[greek|Greek]] chart rested on the copy; a manager's [[greeting|greeting]] survived on the phone. A [[grey|grey]] reverse named a [[grocery|grocery]] meal stop, showing local printing after the office's claimed verification date. Zhao found at least two dispatches following deleted conditions. Ye requested preservation of her knowingly inactive period and offered to identify the scanner. Giving papers had not made her hands innocent, but they could finally point toward a place where she had actually stood.","The group accounted for retained main casing and some divided boxes. Others joined a port-bound supply train. After retention warnings, the office demanded a riverbank branch, concealing original uses from station staff. He aligned phones, copies, splitting sheets and island records on one dispatch timeline; rail staff checked actual switching. Cheng watched the map: the route still reached Linhe, by another road. Chen gave me spare gloves. Documents and people both needed safe return. Tomorrow we would trace the switch order sending retired components back toward tidal water."]});
